<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53562" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρφ-ω</span></b> , poet. Verb, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dry up, wither</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρψω μὲν
				Χρόα καλόν</span>
			<i>will wither</i> the fair skin, <i>wrinkle</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				13.398
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				430
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠέλιος Χρόα κάρφει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					575
				</span></i>
			:—and in 
				Pass.
			, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χρὼς</span>] 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρφεται ἤδη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archil.
					100
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρὶ καρφόμενα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Euph.
					50
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ Χροῒ καρφομένη θρίξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					328
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγήνορα κάρφει Ζεύς</span> Zeus
				<i>withers</i> the proud of heart, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάματοι κάρφοντες γυῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Al.</u>
					383
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴτῳ κάρφεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.1094
				</span></i>
			; 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρφος</span>
			.</div>
